NOTE ON WHAT THIS LICENSE IS
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This license is *based on* the MIT License, with one important change:
commercial use is not permitted.

Because of that change it is NOT the standard MIT License. If you need the
real, unmodified MIT License, you do not have it. Calling this "MIT" in a
contract or a product listing would be inaccurate.

What this means in plain terms:

  YOU MAY                          YOU MAY NOT
  ─────────                        ────────────────────────
  Use it for free                   Sell it, or any part of it
  Run it for your own chama         Charge anyone for it
  Adapt it to your own needs        Use it in a paid or commercial
  Share it with other chamas          product or service
  Study how it works                Distribute it as your own work
  Contribute improvements           Remove the copyright notice

"Chama" means a savings group or cooperative. The spirit here is that any
group may benefit from the software at no cost, while the people who wrote it
are the only ones who may profit from it.

